standRoute.body = standRoute.body.replace("<h2>From floor plan to handover</h2>", "<section><h2>Compare stand proposals against the same brief</h2><p>Use one checklist for each builder so you can compare the same work. Mark every item as included, excluded or supplied by others before approving the quote.</p><table><caption>Stand quote comparison checklist</caption><thead><tr><th>Part of the brief</th><th>What to confirm</th><th>Why it matters</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Stand allocation</th><td>Show, venue, hall, dimensions and open sides</td><td>Layout and site access must match the allocated space.</td></tr><tr><th>Visitor activity</th><td>Products, demonstrations, reception, meetings and storage</td><td>The design needs to support the work visitors will do.</td></tr><tr><th>Build specification</th><td>Drawings, materials, finishes, graphics and lighting</td><td>Compare the same specification, not only the headline total.</td></tr><tr><th>Other suppliers</th><td>Furniture, AV, internet and venue services</td><td>Name what is included, excluded or supplied by others.</td></tr><tr><th>Submissions and dates</th><td>Current manual, drawing deadlines and installation window</td><td>Confirm responsibilities before production; show opening is not the build-up deadline.</td></tr><tr><th>After the show</th><td>Dismantling, transport, reuse and storage requirements</td><td>Include only the services agreed in the quotation.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href=\"/insights/shell-scheme-vs-custom-vs-modular-stands\">Compare shell scheme, custom and modular stand approaches</a></p></section>" + "<h2>From floor plan to handover</h2>");
